~ start
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CutsceneManager.player_face("right")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(3072.0, 300.0), 0.75, 2, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: Hey Az! Are you there?
Az: Yeah. [i]sigh[/i][wait=0.3] Still stuck... 
Az: 'Sup?
Fenn: Why do you, like,[wait=0.3] need your workshop so badly?
Az: All my [i]stuff's[/i] there. Tools,[wait=0.3] devices. You know.
Az: I don't want anyone going through it.
Az annoy: Let alone that [i][shake level=7 rate=30]pathetic excuse of a [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color].[/shake][/i]
Fenn: HEY! [wait=0.3][font_size=35]That's mean.[/font_size]
Az annoy: He trapped [i]all the Knights[/i], Fenn.
Fenn: Well... you said you needed something from your [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color]?
Az: [i]sigh[/i]. Yeah, alright. Fine. 
Az: I need an inhaler. [color="B80006"]Baba[/color] always has a few on him,[wait=0.3] and I keep the rest in my [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color].
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.5")
Fenn worry: Like... for asthma?
Az annoy: [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=20]YES[/shake][/font_size] for asthma. 
Az: [font_size=35][speed=0.7]Why do you think I can't melt any of the ice around here?[/font_size]
Fenn worry: [speed=0.7]The smoke... it'll cause an attack?
Az: Yeah. It's [shake level=7 rate=30][i]not[/i][/shake] pretty.
Fenn: That's why we need the heater?
Az: Yeah. [color="B80006"]Baba's[/color] always been [i]insane[/i] about my asthma. He installed the heater so I can control the temp down here.
Az annoy: He taught me everything I know about blacksmithing, but it's so rare I can even do it.
Az: Where I'm from, [wait=0.3]dirt and grime are signs of [i]hard work[/i]. A badge of [i]honor[/i].
Az: [font_size=30][speed=0.6]And... [shake level=6 rate=15]I've got the cleanest clothes of [font_size=40][i]any[/i][/font_size] blacksmith in [color="0B4F4A"]Codoma[/color].[/shake][/font_size]
Az annoy: [font_size=60][speed=1.2]You know how [/font_size][font_size=70][shake level=7 rate=30][i]embarrassing[/i][/shake][/font_size][font_size=60] that is?[/font_size]
Fenn: ...
Fenn worry: Uh... kinda, I guess...
Fenn: I'm sorry, Az.
Az: It's fine. Not your problem,[wait=0.3] anyway. 
Az: Go grab that heater. We've still got a [color="8A0194"]Wizard[/color] to deal with.
Fenn: Okay, [wait=0.3]on it.
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("9-Az-FiresideChat-1-HeaterArea", true)

=> END